WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.800
<i>Hearts of Plastic. Episode 2: The Hall. Hypothesis: A stool reads as thrown if it is seen in the air for more than half a second.</i>

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.720
<v The First AD>Book eighteen. Odysseus drops Irus. Beggars, to your marks.

3
00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:14.000
<v The Director>Which one is Irus?

4
00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:17.030
<v The First AD>Irus is the one on the left.

5
00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.400
<v Irus>I'm on the right.

6
00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:22.250
<v Odysseus>I am the unknown beggar.

7
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:30.080
<v The Cinematographer>Same head. Same grey beard. Same rags, same staff. Part for part, and colour for colour.

8
00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.170
<v The Director>Wardrobe.

9
00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.920
<v The First AD>He means: can we tell them apart?

10
00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:38.610
<v The Cinematographer>The camera note says: hard to tell apart.

11
00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.060
<v The First AD>Noted. Still wrong.

12
00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:46.090
<v The First AD>Book seventeen. Antinous throws the stool. Take two.

13
00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:48.680
<v Antinous>Which beggar?

14
00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.110
<v The First AD>The one who isn't Irus.

15
00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:53.000
<v Antinous>Which one is Irus?

16
00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.010
<v The Director>Action.

17
00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:00.090
<v The Director>Was that it?

18
00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.340
<v The Cinematographer>A third of a second. And it landed outside the frame.

19
00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:07.490
<i>DAILIES · Antinous Throws the Stool, take 2 (3 Oct, 8135f3e5): the flight, a third of a second</i>

20
00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:13.280
<v The First AD>The experiment. A stool reads as thrown if it is in the air for more than half a second.

21
00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:19.210
<v The Cinematographer>The variable: the flight, a third of a second to six tenths. And smear bricks.

22
00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:20.980
<v The Director>Smear?

23
00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:28.830
<v The Cinematographer>For two drawings the stool is drawn long, in bricks, along its path. The LEGO Movie does it. No blur.

24
00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:32.780
<v The First AD>Held: the voices, the blocking, the lenses. Take three.

25
00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:35.490
<v The Director>Action.

26
00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:42.270
<v Odysseus>I stand like a rock. It's in the book.

27
00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.600
<v The Director>Was that it?

28
00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:46.930
<v The Cinematographer>Six tenths of a second.

29
00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:50.680
<i>DAILIES · Antinous Throws the Stool, take 3: six tenths of a second, two drawings of smear bricks</i>

30
00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:52.830
<v The Director>Print it.

31
00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.780
<v Irus>Do I get a stool?

32
00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:58.390
<v The First AD>You get dropped. Next week.

33
00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:07.600
<i>The voices are synthetic: Kokoro-82M, offline, one for each character. Every incident is from the record; the dailies are the real takes.</i>
